   "properties": {
    "Node name for S&R": "Note"
   },
   "widgets_values": [
    "Geekatplay GenUpscale \u2014 Generative AI Upscaler\nby Geekatplay Studio / Vladimir Chopine\nhttps://www.geekatplay.com\n\nHOW TO USE:\n1. Load your image.\n2. Set total upscale in 'Extra Scale' (GAN gives 4x;\n   0.5 = 2x total, 1.0 = 4x total, 2.0 = 8x total).\n3. Pick a Detail Control preset:\n   archival = exact copy, creative = max generated detail.\n4. Optionally add a short material hint in Prompt Helper\n   (fabrics, skin, foliage \u2014 never scene composition!).\n5. Queue. Compare before/after in the Image Comparer.\n\nEngine: FLUX.1-dev fp8 + jasperai Upscaler ControlNet.\n~16-24GB VRAM. Best realism and faithfulness."
   ],
   "title": "GEEKATPLAY GENUPSCALE \u2014 QUALITY (FLUX)",
   "color": "#432",
   "bgcolor": "#653"
  },
